\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Home Network Security Lab \'97 Master Project Plan (3 Months)\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\fs36 \cf0 1. Project Overview\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf0 Goal:
\f1\b0  Build a fully isolated virtual lab where you can safely practice offensive and defensive network security skills \'97 attacking a deliberately vulnerable machine, capturing and reading the traffic, and then locking it all down behind a real open-source firewall.\

\f0\b Why this order works:
\f1\b0  You can't defend what you don't understand. Month 1 builds the sandbox. Month 2 teaches you to 
\f2\i see
\f1\i0  traffic and basic attacks the way a defender would. Month 3 puts a firewall in front of everything and proves it actually stops what you did in Month 2.\

\f0\b Golden rule \'97 isolation:
\f1\b0  Every VM in this lab lives on a virtual-only network (host-only or internal network mode in your hypervisor), never bridged to your home Wi-Fi/LAN. Metasploitable is intentionally full of unpatched vulnerabilities \'97 it should never get a routable IP on your real network or touch the internet.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

